{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2022-05-02 14:26:00', 'title': 'LILLY DECLARES SECOND-QUARTER 2022 DIVIDEND', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS , MAY 2, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND FOR THE SECOND QUARTER OF 2022 OF\xa0$0.98\xa0PER SHARE ON OUTSTANDING COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE ON\xa0JUNE 10, 2022 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0MAY 16, 2022.'}